{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o060a","title":"刘备还成都任魏延镇汉中","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o060a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备还治成都，提拔魏延为都督镇汉中。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o060a-q"]},{"id":"jfj-a-o046a","label":"正文","text":"刘备留魏延镇汉中诸围","evidence":["jfj-q0171"]},{"id":"liuliao-a-118d62c6f13c58b2e95b","label":"正文","text":"先主拔延督汉中一军尽惊","evidence":["liuliao-q-0810a1f01fa6cf08a5bf"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"任官","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o060a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0091","role":"镇守","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o060a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"成都、汉中","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o060a-q"]},"time":{"year":219,"label":"受汉中王后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y219","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o048","basis":"受汉中王后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o060a-q","xianzhu-q-o048","xianzhu-q-b-c3e56caa3865de7f7114"]},"source_order":[32,280,"O060a"],"order":6588}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0091","name":"魏延","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"jfj-q0171","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-b28aa8ce5009c9675e9e","layer":"original","quote":"初，先主留魏延镇汉中，皆实兵诸围〖1〗，以御外敌；敌若来攻，使不得入。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":214,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuliao-q-0810a1f01fa6cf08a5bf","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-09d2985a3867fd3aa454","layer":"original","quote":"先主为汉中王，（迁）〔还〕治成都，当得重将以镇汉川。众论以为必在张飞，飞亦以心自许；先主乃拔延为督汉中，镇远将军〖3〗，领汉中太守：一军尽惊。先主大会群臣，问延曰：“今委卿以重任，卿居之欲云何〖4〗？”延对曰：“若曹操举天下而来，请为大王拒之；偏将十万之众至，请为大王吞之！”先主称“善”，众咸壮其言。","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o060a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-4b69b4fde2ac4ee74852","layer":"original","quote":"于是还治成都。拔魏延为都督〖31〗，镇汉中。﹝二﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":279,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-c3e56caa3865de7f7114","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c3e56caa3865de7f7114","layer":"modern","quote":"〖11〗二十四年：建安二十四年（公元 219）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":222,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fd85f82251e498647de7","start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o048","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-2d515ba2dae40f6a248e","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年春〖11〗，自阳平南渡沔水，缘山稍前〖12〗，于定军山（势）作营〖13〗。渊将兵来争其地，先主命黄忠乘高鼓噪攻之。大破渊军，斩渊及曹公所署益州刺史赵颙等。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":203,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
